"detached Page Pool can no longer be used to allocate memory. Page Pools wait "
"for all the memory allocated from them to be freed before truly "
"disappearing. \"Detached\" Page Pools cannot be \"re-attached\", they are "
"just waiting to disappear. Attribute is absent if Page Pool has not been "
"detached, and can still be used to allocate new memory."
msgstr ""

